; A round trip back to the page it started from: the soak (`--soak`)
; repeats the steps after `mark-metrics`, answering each check as this run
; answered it, and requires them to leave nothing allocated.
;
; The page keeps the last 60 refreshes in its uptime history, so the scene
; first fills it: the mount's refresh and 59 timed ones, every check
; answered healthy. From then on a refresh lets the oldest round go as it
; adds its own, and the history, and the chart drawn from it, stay the same
; size.
